WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:06,660
I'll transfer the bonus to you first

2
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,070
wait a moment

3
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:10,420
The prize money for this competition is five thousand

4
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:12,420
That should be 1,250 per person

5
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:14,420
Why did I only receive five hundred?

6
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,580
New people are new people

7
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:17,580
little sister

8
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:18,580
The three of us will take you

9
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,580
Don’t you want to form a team and fly hard?

10
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,580
We are not a free team

11
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,620
You didn't say you wanted it at first

12
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,620
You don’t even know the rules yet dare to come and earn bonuses

13
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,620
When I was beaten just now

14
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:28,620
where are you

15
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,540
This is just a game

16
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:32,540
You are beaten because you are not as good at remembering as others.

17
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,540
And after I rescued my opponent,

18
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,540
I will rescue you immediately

19
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,540
You know shit

20
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:37,540
If it weren't for protecting you

21
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:38,540
I will be exposed by him

22
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,540
Isn’t it free to maintain the mecha?

23
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,540
Don’t we need to go to the hospital for our injuries?
